### 7. Conclusion

The Progressive Web Application (PWA) is the most suitable approach for developing the college online canteen food-ordering system. It provides the advantages of both mobile and web applications, including cross-platform compatibility, easy accessibility, offline support, and push notifications.

Its major functionalities, such as menu browsing, food ordering, online payments, and order tracking, make the canteen ordering process faster and more convenient. Although security, server performance, and real-time notifications present development challenges, they can be addressed using appropriate technologies and development practices.

Thus, implementing a PWA can improve the overall efficiency of the college canteen and provide students with a convenient food-ordering experience.
